{"parentUuid":"3f1c20cf-6420-4cd9-b6de-787bce3218ba","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"remote_session_change","url":"https://claude.ai/code/session_017iDndbxnDunVCuTTftZJsZ","commit":"Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017iDndbxnDunVCuTTftZJsZ","pr":"🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_017iDndbxnDunVCuTTftZJsZ","sendUserFileHint":true,"managedCommit":false,"managedPr":false},"type":"attachment","uuid":"ed7b497e-02c5-45a7-9238-48910c51e927","timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:05:00.972Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nAttribution for git commits and pull requests you create from here on (this replaces Claude Code's own earlier attribution guidance, such as a previous copy of this reminder; the user's own instructions about these lines, such as a CLAUDE.md or memory rule, take precedence over this reminder, but do not add attribution lines this reminder leaves out):\n- End git commit messages with:\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017iDndbxnDunVCuTTftZJsZ\n- End pull request descriptions with:\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_017iDndbxnDunVCuTTftZJsZ\n\nThe user can follow this conversation from another device; to put a file in front of them there (a report, a screenshot, a built artifact), send it with SendUserFile.\n</system-reminder>"}],"session_id":"9823c1f0-89f5-4638-9223-c6892607ac2b","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"9823c1f0-89f5-4638-9223-c6892607ac2b","version":"2.1.270","gitBranch":"main"}
