{"parentUuid":"1bebe292-6166-4a0c-8769-4e36fdb67021","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CezyTyvQWFaHucXpN6HDJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The context-posture helper is done. It rated 5 of the 6 areas AMBER (needs attention) and 1 GREEN.\n\nThe most serious finding: the `memory-write` skill still says the Windows laptop was retired on 8/14, and that nothing should be written to its folders. `CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md` and `USER.md` all say Windows is active again. `AGENTS.md` makes `memory-write` win when they disagree, so the stale rule wins.\n\nIt also found:\n- The `dcg` guard is registered twice, so it runs twice on every shell command.\n- Skill descriptions are long, and some project `CLAUDE.md` files hold status notes that belong in `docs/STATUS.md`.\n\n2 helpers are still running: routing and data feeds, and rules and identity."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3754,"cache_read_input_tokens":310631,"output_tokens":325,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":59},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3754,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":325,"cache_read_input_tokens":310631,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3754,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3754},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CezyTxzqX2EVAzppbkk5A","type":"assistant","uuid":"ae92a6e8-6e1e-430c-ad88-4f13c56fb6ac","timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:35:21.880Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"9823c1f0-89f5-4638-9223-c6892607ac2b","sessionKind":"bg","userT