on B, chosen by Eric: the 7 lines `\"ArXiv\"`, `\"ISA\"`, `\"Science\"`, `\"capture-insight\"`,\n   `\"library-review\"`, `\"pp-espn\"`, `\"session-miner\"`: `\"off\"` were removed from `skillOverrides`\n   (absent = on). Host evidence: 99 → 92 overrides, all other settings compared identical after\n   JSON parse; `settings.local.json` has no `skillOverrides`; checker `42 checked, 0 failing`, exit 0.\n4. **First `aios-audit` run** — `docs/audits/aios-audit-2026-09-13.md`, `docs/rot.md` (copy of\n   `~/.claude/rot.md`, `Last audited` column stamped). Check against the `aios-audit` SKILL.md contract\n   and the `rot.md` receipt rule: were only allowed files written, is every stamped date backed by a\n   check that ran, are partial scopes labelled, are there exactly two proposed builds, and does the\n   report avoid claiming more than the delegates checked. The audit's findings about other systems\n   (hooks, GPS, vault) are reported, not fixed, by design.\n\n## Known, not defects\n\n- Task 8 (Pi trial) is paused by Eric.\n- The C-02 recovery-lock residual risk was accepted in round 2.\n- `aios-audit` was executed by hand from a `~/DEV`-rooted session because the project skill is not\n  listed there; its trigger was verified headlessly on 2026-09-12.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"af610238-735d-4210-b883-5c9d46ba90e1","session_id":"9823c1f0-89f5-4638-9223-c6892607ac2b","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"9823c1f0-89f5-4638-9223-c6892607ac2b","version":"2.1.270","gitBranch":"main"}
