{"parentUuid":"218ce14c-f33d-4644-ac93-b3575ddbb4b4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cezz5swV5aUNJec9mEAxj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VMB76Y2KVLNhqP8TSzKiTG","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/.claude/jobs/9823c1f0/tmp/gateC4-feedback.md","content":"# Narrow re-check of the round-3 fixes (2026-09-13)\n\nRound 3 (`gpt-5.6-terra`, base `dae7aeb`) returned REVISE with IR-03 and DOC-01. This inspection\ncovers **only the fix commit** on top of `5c98b06`. Everything before `5c98b06` was reviewed in\nrounds 1–3; do not re-review it.\n\n| ID | Disposition | What changed |\n|---|---|---|\n| IR-03 | ACCEPTED | `scripts/skill-portability-check.py`: `IMPLICIT` patterns (null, boolean, number, timestamp — union of the YAML 1.1 resolver PyYAML uses and the 1.2 core schema) and `_plain_kind()`. `value_kind()` resolves plain inline and multi-line plain scalars against them; quoted and `|`/`>` block scalars stay strings. `NOT_STRING` covers the new kinds, so a wrong-type `name`/`description` is reported once and not content-checked. `y`/`n` are deliberately not treated as booleans (PyYAML and the 1.2 core schema both read them as strings). |\n| DOC-01 | ACCEPTED | `docs/STATUS.md`: `portability_failures=0` since the roster decision. |\n\nHost verification (`docs/audits/evidence/2026-09-13-gate-c/t5g-checker-test.py`): 37/37 fixtures;\nred-green vs `2bcdda2` — the old checker passed `name: true`, `null`, `123`, `1.5`, `2026-09-13`, `Off`,\nthe new one flags them and `description: yes`, `42`, multi-line `~` with a type message; controls\n`\"yes\"`, `'404'`, `true-thing`, `v1.2.3` pass; value kinds agree with PyYAML on all 42 real skills;\nreal roster 42/42; fail-closed 4/4 exit 2.\n\nPlease look for: a string the new patterns wrongly call non-string (false positive on a real skill\nname/description shape), a non-string form still called a string, and any regression in the\nmulti-line plain-scalar path.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3040,"cache_read_input_tokens":350783,"output_tokens":3259,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":470},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3040,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":3259,"cache_read_input_tokens":350783,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3040,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3040},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":5,"requestId":"req_011Cezz5riKecZ4TLNnGZY7n","type":"assistant","uuid":"97bbd185-4a3f-4275-ab11-66f6972e7e80","timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:43:54.752Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"9823c1f0-89f5-4638-9223-c6892607ac2b","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"9823c1f0-89f5-4638-9223-c6892607ac2b","version":"2.1.270","gitBranch":"main"}
