{"parentUuid":"e31b4710-b12d-498b-bd7e-f3e40a835d4c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cezzc4iyPm1ccmDqNbhs4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BeyB5XNkJMLxyDiVSqEEEC","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/audits/2026-09-12-gate-a-approval.md","old_string":"## First `aios-audit` run (2026-09-13)","new_string":"## Final Codex verification — round 4, narrow (2026-09-13)\n\n`gpt-5.6-terra`, effort high, base `5c98b06` (the IR-03 / DOC-01 commit `14b4a8f` only).\nVerdict **REVISE**: the new implicit-type patterns over-classified some strings.\n\n| ID | Finding | Disposition |\n|---|---|---|\n| IR-04 | Number pattern flags `0008`, `0129`, `0:1` as numbers | **Split.** `0:1`: ACCEPTED — PyYAML's sexagesimal int needs a `1-9` lead; fixed. `0008`/`0129`: REJECTED — YAML 1.2 core resolves `[-+]?[0-9]+`, leading zeros allowed. Confirmed with a real 1.2 loader: the `yaml` npm package bundled with Pi returns a number for both. Under the rule \"non-string in either family\", flagging is correct. |\n| IR-05 | Date-only `2026-9-3` flagged as a timestamp | ACCEPTED — date-only needs two-digit month and day; the one-digit form resolves only inside a date-time. Fixed. |\n| (host-found) | While testing: `._1`-style values flagged as floats | Fixed — PyYAML's `.`-leading float needs a digit right after the dot. |\n\nThe number and timestamp patterns are now transcribed one resolver branch at a time from PyYAML\n(YAML 1.1) and the YAML 1.2.2 core schema.\n\nHost verification:\n- `t5h-kind-corpus.py`: 38,454 plain scalars that PyYAML accepts. **0** that PyYAML resolves to a non-string are called strings. All 628 values the checker calls non-string beyond PyYAML match an independently transcribed YAML 1.2 core regex (**0** unjustified). Named cases: `0:1` and `2026-9-3` now strings (the previous checker called them number and timestamp).\n- `t5h-jsyaml.cjs` with Pi's bundled `yaml` library (library load only; Pi not run): `0008` → number, `0:1` → string, `2026-9-3` → string in YAML 1.2 core.\n- Regression: `t5g` fixtures unchanged (37 checked, 26 failing); real roster 42/42; `portability_failures=0`.\n\n**Not re-inspected by Codex.** Four inspection rounds ran this session; a fifth waits on Eric.\n\n## First `aios-audit` run (2026-09-13)"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1431,"cache_read_input_tokens":378050,"output_tokens":1678,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":257},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1431,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":1678,"cache_read_input_tokens":378050,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1431,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1431},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cezzc3K8ZKGn9oJGC1c5D","type":"assistant","uuid":"b639fdf0-7f58-4779-a3dd-91a3765250c4","timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:50:30.120Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"9823c1f0-89f5-4638-9223-c6892607ac2b","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"9823c1f0-89f5-4638-9223-c6892607ac2b","version":"2.1.270","gitBranch":"main"}
