earlier checker fixtures; PyYAML agreement | Needs `uv run --no-project --with pyyaml`. Builds fixtures under a hard-coded job temp path; fails if those folders already exist, so change `t5f-` to a fresh prefix first. Also expects the older fixture homes `t5-badcanon`, `t5-emptycanon`, `t5b-fx-*`. |\n| `t5g-checker-test.py` | IR-03: implicit null/boolean/number/timestamp `name`/`description` rejected; all t5f fixtures; PyYAML agreement; red-green vs `2bcdda2` | Same as `t5f` (fresh `t5g-` prefix needed on a re-run) |\n| `gateC3-feedback.md` | What was sent to Codex for the final verification (round 3) | none |\n| `ir01-redgreen.py` | Checker before `2bcdda2` passes list descriptions; after, flags them | Reads the `t5f-fx` fixtures; read-only |\n| `gateC-dispositions.md` | What was sent to Codex for Gate C round 2 | none |\n\nPaths inside the scripts are absolute and Mac-specific.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":13,"oldLines":6,"newStart":13,"newLines":8,"lines":[" | `c03-probe.py` | C-03 unreadable-transcript count | Creates and removes one probe file under `~/.claude/projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/` |"," | `t5f-checker-test.py` | IR-01 and all earlier checker fixtures; PyYAML agreement | Needs `uv run --no-project --with pyyaml`. Builds fixtures under a hard-coded job temp path; fails if those folders already exist, so change `t5f-` to a fresh prefix first. Also expects the older fixture homes `t5-badcanon`, `t5-emptycanon`, `t5b-fx-*`. |"," | `t5g-checker-test.py` | IR-03: implicit null/boolean/number/timestamp `name`/`description` rejected; all t5f fixtures; PyYAML agreement; red-green vs `2bcdda2` | Same as `t5f` (fresh `t5g-` prefix needed on a re-run) |","+| `t5h-kind-corpus.py` | IR-04/IR-05: `_plain_kind()` vs PyYAML's resolver over 38,454 generated plain scalars, with every over-1.1 call justified by an independent YAML 1.2 core transcription | Read-only; needs `uv run --no-project --with pyyaml` |","+| `t5h-jsyaml.cjs` | Named cases (`0008`, `0:1`, `20