{"parentUuid":"83c4c0bc-e003-49b1-b9c6-42f6fcc8c067","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CezzeY6K3nfnvj9fS6dZn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011zqPFo6hgj6MbJWtbucKrw","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/STATUS.md","old_string":"- **Gate B** (2 rounds) and **Gate C** (2 rounds) run. Every code finding is fixed:\n  C-01 exec bits, C-02 atomic stale-lock reclaim, C-03 usage metrics scoped to Claude\n  transcripts, IR-01 checker rejects list/map descriptions. IR-01 is host-tested but\n  not re-inspected by Codex.","new_string":"- **Gate B** (2 rounds), **Gate C** (2 rounds) and two final Codex verification rounds\n  (3 and 4, `gpt-5.6-terra`) ran on 2026-09-12/13. Every code finding is fixed: C-01 exec\n  bits, C-02 atomic stale-lock reclaim, C-03 usage metrics scoped to Claude transcripts,\n  IR-01 list/map names rejected, IR-03 implicit null/boolean/number/timestamp rejected,\n  IR-04/IR-05 exact YAML grammars (`0008` kept as a number on purpose: YAML 1.2 core).\n  Round 5 checks the last fix, `62fbb72`; see the audit log for its verdict."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":34,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2232,"cache_read_input_tokens":763787,"output_tokens":3491,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":691},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":707,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":103,"cache_read_input_tokens":381540,"cache_creation_input_tokens":707,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":707},"type":"message"},{"input_tokens":343857,"output_tokens":7858,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"advisor_message","model":"claude-fable-5-1"},{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3388,"cache_read_input_tokens":382247,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1525,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1525,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":6,"requestId":"req_011CezzePimjGfo9H1He39ML","type":"assistant","uuid":"6c9dffe5-17a2-4362-ba07-a5cde400666e","timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:52:53.230Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"9823c1f0-89f5-4638-9223-c6892607ac2b","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"9823c1f0-89f5-4638-9223-c6892607ac2b","version":"2.1.270","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"6c9dffe5-17a2-4362-ba07-a5cde400666e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b4c0f99f-d416-4b0a-819d-31601dd3681d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011zqPFo6hgj6MbJWtbucKrw","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/STATUS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"09f7136f-e812-40cb-b0d9-756824b5358b","timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:52:53.358Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/STATUS.md","oldString":"- **Gate B** (2 rounds) and **Gate C** (2 rounds) run. Every code finding is fixed:\n  C-01 exec bits, C-02 atomic stale-lock reclaim, C-03 usage metrics scoped to Claude\n  transcripts, IR-01 checker rejects list/map descriptions. IR-01 is host-tested but\n  not re-inspected by Codex.","newString":"- **Gate B** (2 rounds), **Gate C** (2 rounds) and two final Codex verification rounds\n  (3 and 4, `gpt-5.6-terra`) ran on 2026-09-12/13. Every code finding is fixed: C-01 exec\n  bits, C-02 atomic stale-lock reclaim, C-03 usage metrics scoped to Claude transcripts,\n  IR-01 list/map names rejected, IR-03 implicit null/boolean/number/timestamp rejected,\n  IR-04/IR-05 exact YAML grammars (`0008` kept as a number on purpose: YAML 1.2 core).\n  Round 5 checks the last fix, `62fbb72`; see the audit log for its verdict.","originalFile":"# STATUS\n\nRead this first. Update it before ending every session.\n\nLast updated 2026-09-13 (Mac, background session). Evidence for every claim below is in\n`docs/audits/2026-09-12-gate-a-approval.md`.\n\n## Current state\n- The dominant thread is the **harness-agnostic AIOS plan**:\n  `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-harness-agnostic-aios.md` (approved; do not edit —\n  its SHA-256 `71b5242e…` binds the approval). Goal: every skill Eric owns loads\n  identically in Claude Code, Codex and Pi from one versioned canonical folder, plus a\n  recurring audit that keeps the AIOS from rotting.\n- Architecture: `~/.claude/skills/` (repo `erash11/claude-skills`) is canonical and holds\n  real directories only. `~/.agents/skills/` and `~/.codex/skills/` are generated views\n  rebuilt per machine by `sync-to-codex.sh` / `.ps1` — symlinks on Mac, copies on Windows.\n- **Tasks 1–7 done.** Task 8 (Pi trial) **PAUSED by Eric** (2026-09-13). It also needs\n  `sudo` to create `piuser`. Report and unblock commands: `docs/audits/2026-09-12-pi-trial.md`.\n- **Roster resolved 2026-09-13 (Option B):** the 7 owned skills are on again in Claude Code\n  (`~/.claude` commit `21c686d`). Checker: 42/42 portable.\n- **First `aios-audit` ran 2026-09-13:** `docs/audits/aios-audit-2026-09-13.md`. Two RED:\n  the Codex snapshot hook is a stale copy, and the GPS feed looks frozen since 2026-08-01.\n- **Gate B** (2 rounds) and **Gate C** (2 rounds) run. Every code finding is fixed:\n  C-01 exec bits, C-02 atomic stale-lock reclaim, C-03 usage metrics scoped to Claude\n  transcripts, IR-01 checker rejects list/map descriptions. IR-01 is host-tested but\n  not re-inspected by Codex.\n- Monthly metrics run on launchd `com.keystone.aiosaudit` (day 1, 14:00). It writes a row\n  to `docs/audits/aios-trend.md` and a nudge; it never commits.\n- `portability_failures=0` since the roster decision (2026-09-13). Every layout invariant is 0.\n\n## Next\n- **Audit build 1:** sync the Codex snapshot hook (`~/.codex/hooks/keystone-unified-snapshot.js`\n  is a stale 31-line copy) and fix the \"Windows retired\" rule in `memory-write` and\n  `project_backup-sync-system.md`.\n- **Audit build 2:** Eric confirms where GPS sessions land since 2026-08-24.\n- Other audit proposals (vault note rot, double `dcg` registration, stale router counts,\n  `measure.sh` sort bug): see `docs/audits/aios-audit-2026-09-13.md`.\n- **Task 8 (Pi trial):** paused by Eric.\n\n## Open questions\n- Where do GPS sessions land now: `DataBase_GPS_Reporting` or `Catapult_API`?\n\n## Gotchas\n- Never commit a symlink into `~/.claude/skills/`. Windows pulls that repo and an absolute\n  Mac symlink arrives unusable. A pre-commit hook refuses it.\n- Hooks and sync scripts exist in two copies (`~/.claude/hooks/`, `~/.codex/hooks/`; `.sh`\n  and `.ps1`). Any change patches both.\n- Never run `graphify install --platform agents`: the views link into canonical, so it\n  overwrites the Claude variant. Use `--platform claude` only.\n- `never_used` in the metrics is **Claude Code evidence only**. Check `~/.codex/sessions`\n  before recommending any deletion.\n- `claude -p --disallowedTools Bash` does not block the context-mode MCP shell tools.\n- A concurrent `closeout` commits whatever is uncommitted. Commit at each verified step.\n- `dcg` blocks: `rm -rf` in heredocs, `mv` and `>` redirects on home paths, `git` inside\n  command substitution. Use the Write tool plus a Python file that does the I/O.\n- Never point Pi at `~/DEV` — it ships no sandbox and no approval prompts, by design.\n- Never let any harness near `DexaProject` (identifiable athlete health data, on Google\n  Drive, not in `~/DEV`).\n- Plugin skills (`superpowers`, `mattpocock-skills`) are vendored and out of scope.\n- On the Mac: `timeout` is not installed and Python is PEP 668-managed (stdlib `python3`\n  or `uv`, never global `pip install`).\n- No success claim without pasted command output.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":20,"oldLines":10,"newStart":20,"newLines":12,"lines":["   (`~/.claude` commit `21c686d`). Checker: 42/42 portable."," - **First `aios-audit` ran 2026-09-13:** `docs/audits/aios-audit-2026-09-13.md`. Two RED:","   the Codex snapshot hook is a stale copy, and the GPS feed looks frozen since 2026-08-01.","-- **Gate B** (2 rounds) and **Gate C** (2 rounds) run. Every code finding is fixed:","-  C-01 exec bits, C-02 atomic stale-lock reclaim, C-03 usage metrics scoped to Claude","-  transcripts, IR-01 checker rejects list/map descriptions. IR-01 is host-tested but","-  not re-inspected by Codex.","+- **Gate B** (2 rounds), **Gate C** (2 rounds) and two final Codex verification rounds","+  (3 and 4, `gpt-5.6-terra`) ran on 2026-09-12/13. Every code finding is fixed: C-01 exec","+  bits, C-02 atomic stale-lock reclaim, C-03 usage metrics scoped to Claude transcripts,","+  IR-01 list/map names rejected, IR-03 implicit null/boolean/number/timestamp rejected,","+  IR-04/IR-05 exact YAML grammars (`0008` kept as a number on purpose: YAML 1.2 core).","+  Round 5 checks the last fix, `62fbb72`; see the audit log for its verdict."," - Monthly metrics run on launchd `com.keystone.aiosaudit` (day 1, 14:00). It writes a row","   to `docs/audits/aios-trend.md` and a nudge; it never commits."," - `portability_failures=0` since the roster decision (2026-09-13). Every layout invariant is 0."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6c9dffe5-17a2-4362-ba07-a5cde400666e","session_id":"9823c1f0-89f5-4638-9223-c6892607ac2b","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"9823c1f0-89f5-4638-9223-c6892607ac2b","version":"2.1.270","gitBranch":"main"}
